==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Goob is a wheat-colored craft with a rounded, square-shaped head featuring tufts of fluff on the forehead and cheeks. He sports light yellowish-orange blush beneath his typically-crossed, misaligned googly eyes, complimented by blue freckles above the blush on the left side and red freckles on the right. His torso is also light yellowish orange, adorned with tufts of fluff around the neck. Goob's arms are long and flexible, resembling black, cable-like strings. His hands are large, rounded and mismatched; his left hand is blue on the right side with red claws, while his right hand is red on the left side with blue claws. Additionally, his knees and ankles are marked with light yellowish-orange stripes.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Goob is mostly light gray with a slightly darker gray for his darker parts. His red and blue are respectively swapped out for white and black, and his eyes are pie-cut to the right.
|-|Fun Partygoer=
Fun Partygoer Goob is light blue and has a cone-shaped party hat on his head with light purple and light pink stripes. He has white cheeks with his left having two hollow, light pink triangle marks on the topmost side of the cheek with a light purple on the bottommost side, and vice versa for the right cheek. His torso is light blue and his stomach is white with a pink triangle on the right side of his chest, a purple one on the left side, another pink one near the center of his torso, and another purple one to the left of it. The stripes on his knees and ankles are also now white. His hands are white with light pink middle claws and thumbs, while the remaining claws are light purple. On the palm of his left hand, he has a design of broken heart halves with the left half being light purple and the right half being light pink; vice versa on the right hand.
|-|Special Spaghetti=
Special Spaghetti Goob is colored cream and has slightly darker cheeks with olive green freckles and leg stripes. He has a wavy layer covering his forehead along with its tuft and all over his neck fluff, colored muted red with lighter spots, giving it a tomato sauce-esque appearance. His cream arms are also thinner, resembling noodles. His hands and toes are brown with both lighter and darker spots, resembling meatballs, and his claws are slightly darker, similarly to his sauce.
|-|Neapolitan=
Neapolitan Goob is vanilla colored with a white forehead tuft, pink left cheek tuft, and brown right cheek tuft. His cheeks are light brown with darker hashtag-shaped markings. He has melting Neapolitan ice cream on the left of his head with a light brown cone that has markings similar to his cheeks'. The ice cream is patterned with the pink layer on the left, the white layer on the middle, and the brown layer on the right. His neck fluff also resembles a blob of dripping, Neapolitan ice cream, and is patterned complementary to the ice cream on his head. His legs are light brown with darker stripes, the same color of his arms. His hands have light brown claws and large vanilla spots on the palms, with the left hand colored brown and the right pink.
|-|Garden Blossoms=
Garden Blossoms Goob is pastel green with a hair-like, slightly darker scallop pattern across his forehead, and his tufts of fluff are colored the same. He appears to have two brown whiskers on each of his cheeks. He also sports five-petal flowers with yellow pistils, with a coral pink flower on the upper right corner of his head and on the left of the back of his head, while there are light pink flowers slightly towards the lower right of the coral pink flowers, along with one placed on top of his head, near the corner flower. His neck fluff is a slightly dark, pastel green with a smaller pair of a coral pink and light pink flowers, which are towards the left of the fluff. His arms are brown with hands that are also a slightly dark, pastel green. The hands have brown claws, light pink heart markings on the palms, and a pair of coral and light pink flowers on the back. His legs' lower halves are slightly darker to the pastel green, with an outward curving pattern on the sides. His feet have two brown lines, making him look as if he has toes.
|-|Fuzzy Beast=
Fuzzy Beast Goob is a slightly yellowish green with a round, lighter marking on the lower half of his face. His tufts of fluff are a little spikier and his cheeks are teal with the freckles recolored cream. He has cream colored, layered horns on the upper sides of his head, with the left one curved downward and the right one curved upward. His torso has a lighter stomach and two teal stripes on the back. He now has a small, dinosaur-esque tail overlapping the lower stripe, and it has three cream spikes across the top. He also has teal, bat-like wings on the upper stripe and his neck fluff is jagged and colored teal. His left leg is the lighter yellowish green, while the right leg is teal. Both have darker green stripes and cream toes with black outlining, giving him toes. His left hand is teal and his right the lighter yellowish green, both of which have cream claws.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Goob is a cheerful [[Toon]] known for his energy and innocence, but he is known even more for his iconic love of giving hugs and how much he looks up to [[Scraps]], his older sister. Adding on to the hugs, his interaction with {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} reveals that he genuinely thinks that hugs are simply what others need, rather than using them strategically.

His interactions with Toons like {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}} imply he is naïve and simple-minded, but he is actually far smarter than many realize, capable of understanding and recognizing complex social cues and emotions rather easily (for example, he assumes [[Sprout]]  and {{CI|Bassie|name=true}} are "tense" instead of simply just sad), making him function as a therapist of sorts.

Still, he does have his clumsy, comical moments from time to time, which makes him appear to live up to his name on the outside, but in reality, his heart and smart are balanced evenly.

